    {
      "ordinal": 36,
      "label": "team_0160_head_teacher_20",
      "hash64": "401AC0BBE39734CD",
      "text": "天星隊的戰術和基地都很特別，\\n而且具有獨創性！[VAR 0x0114(000A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 23,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "000A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 37,
      "label": "team_0160_head_teacher_21",
      "hash64": "401ABFBBE397331A",
      "text": "因此，基地會用來當作訓練的設施，\\n並且請天星隊作為ＳＴＣ的工作人員\\r\\n繼續展開活動。[VAR 0x0114(000A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 33,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 44,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "000A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 38,
      "label": "team_0160_head_teacher_22",
      "hash64": "401ABEBBE3973167",
      "text": "……以上。有任何問題嗎？[VAR 0x0114(000A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 12,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "000A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 39,
      "label": "team_0160_botan_07",
      "hash64": "1B118DCD8DCB51E3",
      "text": "不，這聽起來很有趣，\\n而且感覺是一個win-win的結局……[VAR 0x0114(0008)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 30,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0008"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 40,
      "label": "team_0160_fairy_02",
      "hash64": "DD5A983A638C2DB1",
      "text": "由我們來說這句話可能有點怪，\\n但牡丹也一起加油吧！[VAR 0x0114(0020)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 25,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0020"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 41,
      "label": "team_0160_doku_02",
      "hash64": "1D9A2FE70425B6D7",
      "text": "正是如此……\\n牡丹閣下也一起……[VAR 0x0114(0023)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 16,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0023"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 42,
      "label": "team_0160_kakutou_02",
      "hash64": "515BA81EB832E816",
      "text": "我們也一起上下學吧！\\n不論發生什麼事，我們都會保護妳的！[VAR 0x0114(0022)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
